Feathers is a kenku who runs an unmarked repair shop in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], behind a gate and a driveway that leads to a garage. He has jet-black feathers, a full beak, and beady eyes, and wears a red bandana tied over his head. One leg is gone and replaced with a metal prosthetic. He stands about three and a half feet tall, and usually hunched.

He works fast and asks few questions. In about twenty minutes he will repaint a car, give it fresh plates, mend its body and darken its windows, all for about a hundred glint. He works with a joystick that drives spray-paint arms around the car. The party's car is red because of him.
